    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      452.4,
      310.34,
      510.47
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/servitude which is required for apublic purpose.",
