      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      538.8,
      310.15,
      608.87
    ],
    "text": "The land allotment called Devita Meddaliyaddahena in totalextent of about 5.2970 Hectares depicted and prepared bySurveyor General in cadstral map No. 320229(6)2 in Lot No. 24situated in Grama Niladhari Division of Galatha in KandukaraIhala Korale in Divisional Secretary Division of Udapalatha inKandy District, Central Province.",
