    "text": "01. Lot No. 24Amount: 01; Cadastral Plan No.: C.M. 320229(6)2; Date ofinquiries of compensation: 19.12.2018; Time: 10.30 a.m.; Place:Divisional Secretariat, Udapalatha, Gampola.",
